iterations.reply:
The linker rejected the component because the node's `with` clause grants only `Clock`. I can't add the enrichment fetch until the graph definition itself grants `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`. The platform team's approval doesn't change what the linker allows. So I removed the HTTP import and the call. Once the graph grants `HTTPClient`, the fetch can be added back as it was in the previous attempt, and the output won't change, because the fetch result was never used.

